      "scaling": "string list",
      "confidence": "verified",
      "note": "index = 98-09 value (OFF/ECO/TOUR+/eMTB-shortcrank/eMTB+). These are LONG names and the distinction matters: this bike offers TWO eMTB variants as separate assignable modes with different ids sharing the short name eMTB - only the long name separates them (eMTB vs eMTB-shortcrank). Flow shows only one of the two and relabels it plain eMTB so a rider never sees the split. No crank-length field exists anywhere on the bus so neither the bike nor the app can say which variant suits a given crank"
    },
    {
      "id": "98-4E",
