      "scaling": "id+name pairs",
      "confidence": "verified",
      "note": "reply echo of request 98-68 = AVAILABLE_ASSIST_MODES_LOWER - NOT the whole catalog: 98-0F is the UPPER half and a mode can be configured while appearing only there. On this bike 98-68 returned 8 (ECO/ECO+/TOUR/TOUR+/eMTB/eMTB+/TURBO/AUTO) and 98-0F the other 2 (SPORT + the second eMTB variant); the full assignable set is the union"
